# Adobe Design & Creative Source Files
*.psd
*.psb
*.ai
*.eps
*.indd
*.xd
*.sesx

# Temporary, backup & autosave files
*.ai~
*.indd~
*.aep~
*.prproj~
Adobe After Effects Auto-Save/
Adobe Premiere Pro Auto-Save/

# Audio & Media Cache files (Premiere / Audition)
*.cfa
*.pek
* Media Cache/
* Media Cache Files/

# Adobe Bridge & OS thumbnails
Thumbs.db
.BridgeCache
.BridgeCacheT